    .desc = Speak a word of command. The target is forced to its knees.
ent-LavalandRenewalCrystal = anomalous crystal of renewal
    .desc = A humming crystal that pulses with life-giving energy. Use it near a corpse to breathe life back into it.

voice-of-god-self = You speak a word of command at {$target}!
voice-of-god-hit = The voice of {$user} compels you to your knees!
renewal-crystal-revived = The crystal shatters, and {$target} breathes again!
renewal-crystal-healed = The crystal shatters, and its energy knits your wounds!
